      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 34.6,
      "text": "The ______ was that a modern-day climber had died on an alpine slope, since glaciers sometimes yield frozen remains."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        507.4614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        542.0614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 34.6,
      "text": "From the wound&#x27;s depth researchers ______ that an archer shot him from the rear, at about 30 metres."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        462.86141732283465,
        461.8976377952756,
        497.4614173228347
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 34.6,
      "text": "Curators in Bolzano now keep Ötzi, whose 61 tattoos on joints and spine were perhaps an early form of ______."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        435.56141732283464,
        461.8976377952756,
        452.86141732283465
      ],
      "font": "EN",
      "font_size": 11.6,
      "height": 17.3,
      "text": "The archer&#x27;s identity is an enigma, and any motive is ______."
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        344.16141732283467,
        461.8976377952756,
        375.56141732283464
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "误判  1991年阿尔卑斯山发现冰尸，最初被当作现代登山者，救援风钻还损伤了他的髋部。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        305.7614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        337.16141732283467
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "身份  皮革和草编衣物、铜斧与弓箭显示他来自史前；冰人奥茨生活于约5300年前，死时约46岁。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        267.3614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        298.7614173228347
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "死因  2001年发现肩内箭头，扫描显示动脉被撕裂；研究者认为他因此大量失血，数分钟内死亡。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        228.9614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        260.3614173228347
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "重建  据伤口推测，射手从背后约30米放箭；胃中有野山羊肉和脂肪、鹿肉与小麦，据报道在死前两小时内吃下。"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
        190.5614173228347,
        461.8976377952756,
        221.9614173228347
      ],
      "font": "CN",
      "font_size": 10.5,
      "height": 31.4,
      "text": "未解  关节和脊柱上的61处文身，或与早期针灸有关；但射手是谁、为何杀他，仍没有定论。"
    },
